BeyondSlides for Ubuntu
-----------------------

This package targets Ubuntu 24.04 or later on amd64. It installs a verified,
fixed Chromium build under /opt/beyond-slides and a path-scoped AppArmor
profile that permits Chromium to create its renderer sandbox user namespace.
It does not disable Ubuntu's global user-namespace restriction and does not use
Chromium's --no-sandbox option.

Lecture data, checkpoints, login state, and downloaded models remain in each
user's normal data directory and are not removed with the package.
